WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.356
Your study is done. Bring its design, methods, raw
results, and draft together before writing.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:13.935
Trace every claim to its source. Say what you counted,
the units, and what the cost includes.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:22.426
Build figures from the data, then inspect them. Check
every series, label, scale, and panel.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:30.477
Explain what you built, how you tested it, what
happened, and its limits. Verify every reference.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:38.998
Rebuild from the actual submission files. Check the
build, fonts, filenames, and required inputs.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:47.488
People review the names, AI use, rights, and final
claims. ArxivChecker cannot guarantee acceptance.
